    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/937761e1d9342e5948b6c0dc782cdae9.avif?t=1752500677\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the boundless world of <i>Mapama</i>, an <strong>MMO</strong> filled with <strong>adventure</strong>, <strong>naval battles</strong>, and <strong>treasures</strong>! Command your <strong>own ship</strong> and sail through a vast ocean, visiting <strong>numerous ports</strong> where you can stock up on provisions for your crew, trade goods, and acquire valuable upgrades for your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You begin humbly with a small single-masted <strong>sloop</strong>, armed with two cannons. However, by skillfully gathering wood, ores, and other resources, you can <strong>constantly improve your ship</strong>. Rise to command the mighty <strong>ketch</strong>, or dominate the seas aboard a grand <strong>galleon</strong> or <strong>frigate</strong>. <br> <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/2f84dfbe50138239ea3d856f9fb7da14.poster.avif?t=1752500677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/2f84dfbe50138239ea3d856f9fb7da14.webm?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/2f84dfbe50138239ea3d856f9fb7da14.mp4?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of Mapama, there are numerous <strong>professions</strong> you can master: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Carpentry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Metalworking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Naval Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Trade </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The further you advance in your chosen profession, the <strong>more powerful</strong> your abilities become: whether it's faster gathering of rare resources, more efficient naval battles, or better trade deals in the ports. Your success depends on your expertise! <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/8c1fd252f0f7b0af03ae21ab84374731.poster.avif?t=1752500677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/8c1fd252f0f7b0af03ae21ab84374731.webm?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/8c1fd252f0f7b0af03ae21ab84374731.mp4?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ocean is full of <strong>dangers and mysteries</strong>: face mighty ghost ships, plunder enemy trade convoys, go on treasure hunts, or lead your crew to uncharted shores. For the brave, there are also <strong>PvP battles</strong> where you can prove your skills against other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organize yourself with friends in a party or join a <strong>guild</strong>. Together, you can influence pricing in ports and even <strong>conquer entire towns</strong>. In parties, gold and experience are fairly shared as you sail across the seas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ship is your lifeline\u2014equip it with better sails, stronger cannons, and a magnificent figurehead. Every decision you make brings you closer to becoming the ultimate pirate captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set sail and become a legend on the stormy oceans of <i>Mapama</i>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/937761e1d9342e5948b6c0dc782cdae9.avif?t=1752500677\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the boundless world of <i>Mapama</i>, an <strong>MMO</strong> filled with <strong>adventure</strong>, <strong>naval battles</strong>, and <strong>treasures</strong>! Command your <strong>own ship</strong> and sail through a vast ocean, visiting <strong>numerous ports</strong> where you can stock up on provisions for your crew, trade goods, and acquire valuable upgrades for your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You begin humbly with a small single-masted <strong>sloop</strong>, armed with two cannons. However, by skillfully gathering wood, ores, and other resources, you can <strong>constantly improve your ship</strong>. Rise to command the mighty <strong>ketch</strong>, or dominate the seas aboard a grand <strong>galleon</strong> or <strong>frigate</strong>. <br> <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/2f84dfbe50138239ea3d856f9fb7da14.poster.avif?t=1752500677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/2f84dfbe50138239ea3d856f9fb7da14.webm?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/2f84dfbe50138239ea3d856f9fb7da14.mp4?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of Mapama, there are numerous <strong>professions</strong> you can master: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Carpentry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Metalworking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Naval Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Trade </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The further you advance in your chosen profession, the <strong>more powerful</strong> your abilities become: whether it's faster gathering of rare resources, more efficient naval battles, or better trade deals in the ports. Your success depends on your expertise! <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/8c1fd252f0f7b0af03ae21ab84374731.poster.avif?t=1752500677\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/8c1fd252f0f7b0af03ae21ab84374731.webm?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701080/extras/8c1fd252f0f7b0af03ae21ab84374731.mp4?t=1752500677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ocean is full of <strong>dangers and mysteries</strong>: face mighty ghost ships, plunder enemy trade convoys, go on treasure hunts, or lead your crew to uncharted shores. For the brave, there are also <strong>PvP battles</strong> where you can prove your skills against other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organize yourself with friends in a party or join a <strong>guild</strong>. Together, you can influence pricing in ports and even <strong>conquer entire towns</strong>. In parties, gold and experience are fairly shared as you sail across the seas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ship is your lifeline\u2014equip it with better sails, stronger cannons, and a magnificent figurehead. Every decision you make brings you closer to becoming the ultimate pirate captain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set sail and become a legend on the stormy oceans of <i>Mapama</i>!</p>",
